    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 15 Patrician Villas to the market. This three-bedroom end of terrace family home is situated amongst the leafy surrounds of this mature residential area just off Stillorgan Park Road. This home benefits from having many of the necessary attributes a family could possibly want, situated in a quiet cul-de-sac with a private rear garden and all within striking distance to schools, transport links and local shops.\n\nThe accommodation, which requires modernisation but offers tremendous potential, has a feeling of space and brightness throughout and briefly comprises an entrance hallway, living room with study to the front, a family bathroom and a kitchen/breakfast room with access to the private rear garden. An extension to the side provides additional living space. On the first floor there are three bedrooms and an ensuite.\n\nOutside the property doesn't disappoint, there is gated off street parking to the front while to the rear garden is west facing, and benefits from afternoon and evening sunshine. There is also a practical shed for all your storage needs.\n\nThe convenience of the location cannot be overstated. Situated within walking distance of both Blackrock & Stillorgan villages with their extensive variety of excellent shops, shopping centres, cinemas, restaurants and bars. Public transport is well catered for with the QBC just a stones throw away and both the LUAS and DART within moments' drive. UCD is also extremely convenient, only a five-minute drive or bus journey away.\n\nFEATURES\nExtending to C. 98 sqm\n3 bedroom, 2 reception rooms\nExcellent potential\nLovely cul-de-sac position\nLarge site\nExtended to side\nSunny west facing back garden\nTop convenient location\nStillorgan Village walking distance\n\nACCOMMODATION (measurements as per floor plan)\nEntrance Hallway\nLiving room\nFamily room\nKitchen\nBathroom\nBedroom 1\nEn-suite\nBedroom 2\nBedroom 3"
      },
